  m_text: "Help Chuck deliver his packages for the day!\n\nUse the mouse to drag
    the packages from the conveyor belt \n\nYou will need to complete certain quota
    each day but you can take on more deliveries to test your skills\n\nTo deliver
    to the receipients, click on them to deliver"
